    "basis": "The risk is approved subject to stringent risk mitigation conditions. While the TIV and hazard profile (flammable solvents, exothermic reactions) are significant, the primary concerns regarding ignition sources (aged wiring) and suppression (lack of sprinklers) can be managed through mandatory pre-inception audits and a structured improvement roadmap. The 25% loading is a starting point, but the increased deductible for CAT perils is required to address the elevated flood vulnerability.",
